{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Food Facility</strong> is a game where you build a complex factory to produce food as efficiently as possible\u2014all within the tight space you're given.<u><strong> </strong></u><br> <br><strong><u>Droppers</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Droppers release ingredients that can be combined, compressed, mixed, and more. Discover multiple ways to transform these items into food products.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/extras/c697d592250538acf7d6c6f4996ff6df.poster.avif?t=1765469205\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/extras/c697d592250538acf7d6c6f4996ff6df.webm?t=1765469205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/extras/c697d592250538acf7d6c6f4996ff6df.mp4?t=1765469205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Combine things!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take ingredients from your droppers and feed them into machines like the Mixer\u2014combine flour and sugar into dry mix, or experiment with more advanced machines as your factory grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/extras/3ae9fde10b77d2c8b8ad3e55c3126365.poster.avif?t=1765469205\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/extras/3ae9fde10b77d2c8b8ad3e55c3126365.webm?t=1765469205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/extras/3ae9fde10b77d2c8b8ad3e55c3126365.mp4?t=1765469205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Tiers</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock tiers to progress your factory! Discover hidden recipes and occasionally new machinery as you advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/extras/f386f4b6e2507959a0222c5364b0de43.poster.avif?t=1765469205\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/extras/f386f4b6e2507959a0222c5364b0de43.webm?t=1765469205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/extras/f386f4b6e2507959a0222c5364b0de43.mp4?t=1765469205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Shop</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ingredients don\u2019t appear out of nowhere! Buy what you need to keep your factory running.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/extras/8601c2bba00ee054aaaeb9e6784acca0.poster.avif?t=1765469205\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/extras/8601c2bba00ee054aaaeb9e6784acca0.webm?t=1765469205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/extras/8601c2bba00ee054aaaeb9e6784acca0.mp4?t=1765469205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Contracts</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on contracts to boost your factory\u2019s profits and earn even more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/extras/494ffe5565bcc470eb33674f7789bbac.poster.avif?t=1765469205\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/extras/494ffe5565bcc470eb33674f7789bbac.webm?t=1765469205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/extras/494ffe5565bcc470eb33674f7789bbac.mp4?t=1765469205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Rich Boi","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3880880/96a7f5c7ad6933afff090be7b517300fb108aceb.jpg"},{"name":"Really Rich Boi","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3880880/96a7f5c7ad6933afff090be7b517300fb108aceb.jpg"},{"name":"YOUR A MILLIONARE!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3880880/96a7f5c7ad6933afff090be7b517300fb108aceb.jpg"},{"name":"True Businessman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3880880/467453fd67212af08e0c8b5718b3ae29b4bd3669.jpg"},{"name":"Yes.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3880880/12b6efd770ca4930b18d68fcb8405f41c068e063.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3880880?t=1765469205","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3880880?t=1765469205","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/5944aac0c9e462189e48a6d5daf068fbbb3de687/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765469205","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/5944aac0c9e462189e48a6d5daf068fbbb3de687/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765469205","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achi